I’ll send that to Repeater and play around with it a bit. I don’t need theowa_goandowa_submit_btnparameters. I can also remove the parameters in the URL, and it still returns the same failed login message. I’ll changeowa_actiontobase.usersChangePassword. On sending, there’s a new error:


